,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-22T18:22:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T16:12:22Z","closed_at":"2025-08-24T16:08:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nCurrent master, has been a problem for as long as I can remember.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (28499e344) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8097) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.90 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the mouse hovers over a BlendSpace1D, BlendSpace2D or StateMachine (not BlendTree), focus is immediately grabbed by them, indicated by a blue highlight in the default theme.\n\nNot only does this not serve much of a purpose and is against editor conventions, when copying or editing text, such as blend position in a BlendSpace, or advance conditions for a transition in StateMachine, or simply typing something in the Script Editor, text editing is interrupted and leads to constant friction and misfires. I often think I've copied an advance condition for a transition to paste elsewhere but my mouse entered StateMachine's window too quickly and it stole focus before the copy.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a project.\n- Create an AnimationTree.\n- Set its root node to BlendSpace1D/BlendSpace2D/StateMachine.\n- Start typing text anywhere else in the editor and hover your mouse over the AnimationTree view.\n- Note that typing was interrupted.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109880/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}